      "name": "Clear A Path",
      "actions": 1,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Requirements The Leadsmith is wielding a firearm or crossbow in one hand, and their other hand either wields a one-handed melee weapon or is empty\n\n---\n\nEffect The Leadsmith makes a melee attack and then reloads their gun in one fluid movement. The Leadsmith makes a one-handed melee weapon Strike or unarmed Strike against an opponent within reach, then Interacts to reload. The Leadsmith doesn't need a free hand to reload in this way."
    },
